  "body": "The post-merge batch gate failed on `893e749c09f5cd8b4253e72b9f3da047c562ebc3`.\n\nRun: https://github.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/actions/runs/45039322328\n\nFailing steps:\n```\n  FAIL     4s  motion suites: multiaxis  failed: tests/multiaxis.rs [tests: rapids_hold_the_pose_they_inherit]\n  FAIL     0s  motion suites: multiaxis_avoid  failed: tests/multiaxis_avoid.rs [tests: dodging_never_moves_the_ball]\n  FAIL     0s  motion suites: multiaxis_rough  failed: tests/multiaxis_rough.rs [tests: rapids_and_floors_hold_no_pose_and_flanks_do]\n```\n\nEach push to main has its own run, so this run gates exactly this commit. If the run of the commit before it is green, this commit broke main. Fix it in the normal order; this issue closes itself on the next green run.\n\n<!-- post-merge-last-sha: 835556814a9dc79ce7669320f402184b8ac7f8af -->",
